  "reflectionText": "The Lord brought Abram outside and said: look now toward the sky and count the stars, if you are able. So shall your offspring be. Abram believed, and it was counted to him for righteousness. What is it to be brought outside in the night and told that what cannot yet be counted in the sky is the size of what your name is going to become?"
